<title>PHILIPPINES: Meralco declares 1.50 peso cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Meralco declares 1.50 peso cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Manila Electric Co (Meralco) said on Tuesday its board of directors approved a 1.50 peso cash dividend for common shareholders.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable on September 30. Ex-date was set on August 6 while the record date was set on August 15.</p>
<p>Earlier this year, the firm also granted a cash dividend of 1.50 pesos.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
